    "name": "UnderPath",
    "steam_appid": 3293030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/d5e268f4876589bd8019070f7cfaa299.poster.avif?t=1734464234\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/d5e268f4876589bd8019070f7cfaa299.webm?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/d5e268f4876589bd8019070f7cfaa299.mp4?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UnderPath</strong> takes you into a dark and mysterious world where danger lurks around every corner. One of the many ominous locations you'll explore is Pinecreek Forest,a dense, haunting woodland filled with unsettling sounds and hidden threats. As you progress, the story unfolds through hidden documents and the horrors you encounter, revealing dark secrets about your past and the world around you. The oppressive atmosphere will challenge your instincts as you venture deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/a56386bf1dab72d2ec603e996bb6a64b.avif?t=1734464234\" data-has-big width=800 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/3ce53a2d50f764de00c9cac76dff9d54.poster.avif?t=1734464234\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/3ce53a2d50f764de00c9cac76dff9d54.webm?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/3ce53a2d50f764de00c9cac76dff9d54.mp4?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you\u2019ll loot valuable resources to craft weapons and upgrades, necessary for survival against the zombies and demons that hunt you. Along the way, solve puzzles, avoid deadly traps, and manage your resources carefully. Every decision you make will impact the story, leading to different outcomes as you navigate through this terrifying world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/f205f9c34871e27a5f75b0160b4d6f19.poster.avif?t=1734464234\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/f205f9c34871e27a5f75b0160b4d6f19.webm?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/f205f9c34871e27a5f75b0160b4d6f19.mp4?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror in <strong>UnderPath</strong> is relentless and drives the story forward, keeping you constantly on edge. Dark, oppressive environments and gruesome creatures pull you deeper into the mystery, while unsettling sounds and sudden threats heighten the tension. Each encounter serves as a reminder that the unknown is your greatest enemy, pushing you further into the darkness to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/5ba4a2897b5f7fc0896a340c212bdc3b.poster.avif?t=1734464234\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/5ba4a2897b5f7fc0896a340c212bdc3b.webm?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/5ba4a2897b5f7fc0896a340c212bdc3b.mp4?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is brutal and tactical. To defeat your enemies, you must first weaken them by severing their limbs, making them vulnerable to a precise headshot. Alternatively, enemies can be taken down through their lifepool, but limb dismemberment saves valuable ammunition and time in battle. Whether you\u2019re fighting zombies or supernatural horrors, every encounter is a strategic test of your combat skills and survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/94b05722f3f54d945212bec4ca2d1c73.avif?t=1734464234\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pinecreek Forest</strong>: Explore dense, haunted woodlands filled with hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and craft</strong>: Gather resources to craft and upgrade weapons to improve your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror atmosphere</strong>: Experience constant tension in a world designed to scare you, with terrifying sounds and visuals around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal combat mechanics</strong>: Weaken enemies by severing limbs, then finish them off with headshots to save ammunition, or defeat them by managing their lifepool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple locations</strong>: Explore a variety of dark environments, each filled with puzzles, hidden secrets, and unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two endings</strong>: Your choices determine the fate of your character, leading to one of two different endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/d5e268f4876589bd8019070f7cfaa299.poster.avif?t=1734464234\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/d5e268f4876589bd8019070f7cfaa299.webm?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/d5e268f4876589bd8019070f7cfaa299.mp4?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UnderPath</strong> takes you into a dark and mysterious world where danger lurks around every corner. One of the many ominous locations you'll explore is Pinecreek Forest,a dense, haunting woodland filled with unsettling sounds and hidden threats. As you progress, the story unfolds through hidden documents and the horrors you encounter, revealing dark secrets about your past and the world around you. The oppressive atmosphere will challenge your instincts as you venture deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/a56386bf1dab72d2ec603e996bb6a64b.avif?t=1734464234\" data-has-big width=800 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/3ce53a2d50f764de00c9cac76dff9d54.poster.avif?t=1734464234\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/3ce53a2d50f764de00c9cac76dff9d54.webm?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"