avif?t=1734464234\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/5ba4a2897b5f7fc0896a340c212bdc3b.webm?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/5ba4a2897b5f7fc0896a340c212bdc3b.mp4?t=1734464234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is brutal and tactical. To defeat your enemies, you must first weaken them by severing their limbs, making them vulnerable to a precise headshot. Alternatively, enemies can be taken down through their lifepool, but limb dismemberment saves valuable ammunition and time in battle. Whether you\u2019re fighting zombies or supernatural horrors, every encounter is a strategic test of your combat skills and survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293030/extras/94b05722f3f54d945212bec4ca2d1c73.avif?t=1734464234\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pinecreek Forest</strong>: Explore dense, haunted woodlands filled with hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and craft</strong>: Gather resources to craft and upgrade weapons to improve your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror atmosphere</strong>: Experience constant tension in a world designed to scare you, with terrifying sounds and visuals around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal combat mechanics</strong>: Weaken enemies by severing limbs, then finish them off with headshots to save ammunition, or defeat them by managing their lifepool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple locations</strong>: Explore a variety of dark environments, each filled with puzzles, hidden secrets, and unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two endings</strong>: Your choices determine the fate of your character, leading to one of two different endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
